    "sections": {
        "description": "CTRSpace Lite is a fast, minimal blogging theme built for readability and speed. A ground-up rewrite of the original CTRSpace Lite, it ships no bundled frameworks — no Bootstrap, no icon fonts, just clean semantic markup and a small, dependency-free stylesheet. Customize your logo, accent color and typography from the Customizer, and get a fully responsive, translation-ready, widget-ready blog theme with block-editor support out of the box. Want more? CTRSpace Lite pairs with CTRSpace X (https://www.ctrspace.com/) for magazine and news layouts, ad management, analytics and AI-assisted publishing tools."
    },
